<title>USA: Allied Capital Lending Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Allied Capital Lending Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.35		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			  1,778		    1,402</p>
<p> Investment inc	   2,264		    2,327</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,072		    4,381</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.91		    $0.91</p>
<p> Net			  4,254		    3,995</p>
<p> Investment inc	   6,454		    5,925</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,672		    4,381</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Allied Capital Lending Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said loan origination continued to increase. In the third quarter, Allied said it originated $13 million in new loans, a 13 percent increase over the company's average quarterly loan origination rate of $11.5 million.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
